<title>GERMANY: Telekom sees higher 1997 sales.</title>
<headline>Telekom sees higher 1997 sales.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phone giant Deutsche Telekom AG expects its sales in Germany to rise this year, management board chairman Ron Sommer told shareholders on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;For 1997 we expect sales growth in Germany that is clearly higher than the year before,&quot; Sommer told the annual general meeting, the first gathering of shareholders since the company's flotation last November.</p>
<p>Around 20,000 shareholders were registered to attend the AGM.</p>
<p>-- William Boston, Frankfurt Newsroom, 49 69 756525</p>
